- * `mcp_servers.json` (MCPRepository), performs the 2025-06-18 initialize
- * handshake, pulls tools and registers them in ToolRegistry as
- * `mcp.<serverId>.<tool>` (policy table `mcp.*` governs them, LOCAL_ONLY).
- *
